  /// Phase 24 — "Submission History". Virtual back-relation; the version table
  /// is new. @@unique([assignmentId, studentId]) above is DELIBERATELY LEFT
  /// INTACT: this row stays the single CURRENT submission every Phase 10 query
  /// already assumes, and superseded attempts live in the child table.
