enum TenantStatus {
  ACTIVE
  SUSPENDED
  TRIAL
  CANCELLED

  /// W1.5 — PRD §5.1 "Tenant deletion and data archival", non-destructively.
  ///
  /// The PRD names the capability, and §46.3 names "Data-retention policies"
  /// and "Data-deletion workflows" — but defines no retention period, no
  /// archive format and no restore procedure anywhere. So this is the half the
  /// PRD DOES define: the university stops serving traffic and every row it
  /// owns is kept.
  ///
  /// Deliberately NOT a hard delete. Deleting a Tenant cascades its users,
  /// roles, campuses, subscriptions, students and results away, and no
  /// requirement asks for that. ARCHIVED blocks access exactly as SUSPENDED
  /// and CANCELLED already do — both the login route and tenant resolution
  /// refuse anything that is not ACTIVE or TRIAL — and is reversible.
  ARCHIVED
}

